      "content": "i don't think i can just \"find presence\" in a moment anymore. every time i try, it just reminds me how much of a lie it all is. it feels like i'm just stalling, dragging out something that's already over. if everything is eventually going to be swallowed by the void anyway, isn't it just more honest to just... stop? to stop pretending that any of this matters?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
